{"3688770": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "NeuroCorp", "steam_appid": 3688770, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688770/extras/3d0c458908ca6f1564fcb5b288f13516.avif?t=1774024957\" width=1280 height=283 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We welcome you to NEUROCORP, the tech company that extends a hand to humans. And thanks to you, soon we will improve our Artificial General Intelligence (all work will be off the books, of course).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the many abandoned places of Grimm City, capital of progress and future tech, with a team of up to 6 colleagues and search for Neural Abled Bodies (or NABs) to acquire that precious consciousness they may have. Don't forget to use voice chat to communicate with your colleagues!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688770/extras/1702912da6cf23354f913776c31a1604.poster.avif?t=1774024957\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688770/extras/1702912da6cf23354f913776c31a1604.webm?t=1774024957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688770/extras/1702912da6cf23354f913776c31a1604.mp4?t=1774024957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No job? Don't worry, NEUROCORP is hiring! You can work for us, no experience needed. Collect bodies and bringing them to the nearest Recycler unit for consciousness extraction and capsule storage. This is your top priority, so don't get distracted by all the scrap scattered around. While tempting, it won't help you reach your quota.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688770/extras/c88095f26dd7a77286bda714f37e45eb.poster.avif?t=1774024957\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688770/extras/c88095f26dd7a77286bda714f37e45eb.webm?t=1774024957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688770/extras/c88095f26dd7a77286bda714f37e45eb.mp4?t=1774024957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sounds easy enough, right? Oh, but be careful with the unwanted visitors! While NEUROCORP is not reliable for any damage to your bio defect, we offer a generous health insurance package that can be reclaimed after you’ve flatlined. Health kits and serums are also available to purchase at your nearest NeuroShop™.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688770/extras/864f4c4a557bd1d9fb648fb00db08533.poster.avif?t=1774024957\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688770/extras/864f4c4a557bd1d9fb648fb00db08533.webm?t=1774024957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688770/extras/864f4c4a557bd1d9fb648fb00db08533.mp4?t=1774024957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you happen to scavenge some scrap, however, you can use it to upgrade yourself with some cyber-tech, state of the art tools and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688770/extras/25f9d3afde8e95fee252fa6cbb422cea.poster.avif?t=1774024957\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688770/extras/25f9d3afde8e95fee252fa6cbb422cea.webm?t=1774024957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688770/extras/25f9d3afde8e95fee252fa6cbb422cea.mp4?t=1774024957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a good day of work, you can change and improve the aesthetics of your hideout. Purchase furniture and customize your lobby apartment and show it off to your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688770/extras/ac6f5b8e1e83364ddbc51a20fdf4826c.poster.avif?t=1774024957\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688770/extras/ac6f5b8e1e83364ddbc51a20fdf4826c.webm?t=1774024957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688770/extras/ac6f5b8e1e83364ddbc51a20fdf4826c.mp4?t=1774024957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What? You’re still here? Just get out there and collect some consciousness. Don’t worry, we pay handsomely!!! What do we need this consciousness for? For no particular reason…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You work for Neurocorp. Deliver the quota. Don’t fail. Or be repurposed.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688770/extras/3d0c458908ca6f1564fcb5b288f13516.avif?t=1774024957\" width=1280 height=283 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We welcome you to NEUROCORP, the tech company that extends a hand to humans. And thanks to you, soon we will improve our Artificial General Intelligence (all work will be off the books, of course).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the many abandoned places of Grimm City, capital of progress and future tech, with a team of up to 6 colleagues and search for Neural Abled Bodies (or NABs) to acquire that precious consciousness they may have. Don't forget to use voice chat to communicate with your colleagues!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688770/extras/1702912da6cf23354f913776c31a1604.poster.avif?t=1774024957\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688770/extras/1702912da6cf23354f913776c31a1604.webm?t=1774024957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688770/extras/1702912da6cf23354f913776c31a1604.mp4?t=1774024957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No job? Don't worry, NEUROCORP is hiring! You can work for us, no experience needed. Collect bodies and bringing them to the nearest Recycler unit for consciousness extraction and capsule storage. This is your top priority, so don't get distracted by all the scrap scattered around. While tempting, it won't help you reach your quota.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\